# 16. SAFE LAB TESTING

Use an intentionally vulnerable application with a controlled directory.

Example:

```text
lab-app/
├── public/
│   └── files/
│       └── test.txt
├── lab-secret/
│   └── training.txt
└── app.py
```

The goal is to demonstrate that the application can improperly leave:

```text
public/files/
```

and reach:

```text
lab-secret/
```

without touching real system files.

